<div class="side-by-side">
  <h2>The Challenge</h2>

  <p>
    Fortnite OG was an emotional, exciting moment for the entire Fortnite
    community. In a first-of-its-kind content event, fans returned to the
    original map that was removed from the game back in 2017. To promote this
    legacy event and celebrate with fans and influencers alike, Epic Games
    needed a can’t-miss tournament that felt like a true homecoming for the
    community.
  </p>
</div>



