<h2>The Solution</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Class of 2017</p>
  <p>
   "The Reunion" as a concept drew clear
    connections to class reunions and seeing old friends from the past. I developed the concept into a trailer
    direction, while the team worked to secure the OG creators fans knew and loved.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">A Delicious Trailer With a Side of Nostalgia</p>
  <p>
    I pitched the Fortnite team on
    a massive cake shaped like the returning map. Epic
    worked closely with me to confirm which iconic locations would be
    returning so we could accurately recreate them.
  </p>
</div>

