<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Extending The Style</p>
  <p>
    With the trailer direction approved, its same bright, colorful style
    would extend to the rest of the event. We worked closely with the
    Fortnite team on logos, concepts, and broadcast design, until we were ready to reveal the cake and announce the event in spectacular fashion.
  </p>
